      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ae802a43ca0e56248e5cf8b|full_name} my newer public beerpong (actually called cuppong) has around 1900 triggers but they are not going off all at once. Max per second is around 400 trigger.\nOne thing i did notice is that is that the longer the world is up for, say over an hour, the more likely you are going to lag more and more, leading to triggers failing to sync and increasing lag with every trigger fire off. I agree that the vrc team needs to look into the trigger and event system to optimize them a bunch more.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
